25,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Transport costs vary wildly depending on distance, and whole-building lets have non-refundable deposits if people drop out.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"It seems mixing happens during shared evenings, but some members never even attend the away camps.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Public bookings are a lottery nightmare with huge applications, and cooking for ourselves takes way too much time.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Rin,,"The inland clubs slept eight to a room with strict lights-out, and our own hall is already crowded.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"Public beds are cheap, but a third of our members can't reach campus by nine without overnight stays.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Mio,,That's a lot of risk with the deposits. Maybe we should avoid the lodge?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"If we want the members to bond, we must ensure they actually stay together.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,The administrative burden of public centers sounds exhausting for the organizers.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Rin,,Eight people to a room sounds like a nightmare! I don't want to be tired.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Misaki,,And the campus option isn't as simple as it looks for the commuters.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
