50,3,1,talk,Mio,,"So we have Campus Intensive, Mountain Training Centre, or Coastal Lodge. I'm leaning away from the lodge.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"The lodge would keep us together, but the cost and attendance are concerns.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The Mountain Centre is a bureaucratic mess. Campus seems the most stable, despite the timing.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Rin,,Campus is too crowded and the Mountain Centre sounds like a dormitory from a horror movie!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Campus requires extra beds for some, and the Mountain Centre is cheap but restrictive.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Mio,,I'll vote for Campus Intensive. It's the safest for the budget.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"I want the bonding of a lodge, but I'll consider the others.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,I vote for Campus Intensive. I cannot deal with a nine-page lottery application.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Rin,,"I vote for the Coastal Lodge! I want a real vacation feel, not a crowded hall.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Misaki,,I'll vote for Campus Intensive. It's the most transparent for the accounts.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,pass,Mio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I will vote for the Coastal Lodge as well. The social aspect is too important.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
